botw-save-convert
=================

This project is a Rust reimplementation of the save conversion logic from
BotW Save Manager:

    https://github.com/DeltaJordan/BotW-Save-Manager

BotW Save Manager is itself a fork of WemI0's BOTW_SaveConv. The original
project credits Jordan Marine (DeltaJordan) and Arch Leaders, among other
contributors.

The conversion algorithm, version/header tables, hash table, and item table in
this project are ported from the original C# implementation. The original work
is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3.

Added in this port (not present upstream): a reader for the record-table
container shared by option.sav, game_data.sav and caption.sav, and a downgrade
path that drops the fields introduced after Wii U 1.5.0 and retags the header
to 0x471b. The new field hashes were derived by diffing real v1.5 / v1.6 /
v1.8-v1.9 saves, and cross-checked against the format notes of
https://github.com/fabiangonzalezdev/Universal-BOTW-Save-Manager

